  "body": "Private. Secure. Stylish. Exceptional coastal living.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated and privately positioned down a driveway, this elegant three-bedroom home offers an exceptional blend of contemporary style, privacy and effortless living in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from Madills Farm, Tamaki Drive, the waterfront and St Heliers village, the location is simply outstanding.\r\n\r\nQuality finishes feature throughout, from beautiful timber flooring, plantation shutters and skylights to the stunning entertainer's kitchen, complete with premium Bosch appliances, bespoke cabinetry and Häfele fittings.\r\n\r\nLight-filled living spaces open through bifold doors to a sunny, north-facing courtyard, creating the perfect setting for entertaining or simply relaxing in privacy. Two separate living areas and two private balconies provide additional spaces to retreat and unwind.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms and two beautifully renovated bathrooms\r\n• Stunning entertainer's kitchen with premium Bosch appliances\r\n• Two separate living areas and two private balconies\r\n• Sunny, north-facing entertaining courtyard\r\n• Beautiful timber flooring, skylights and plantation shutters\r\n• Double internal-access garage plus three off-street parks\r\n• Exceptional privacy in a secure, secluded setting\r\n• Walking distance to Madills Farm, the waterfront and St Heliers village\r\n• Zoned for Kohimarama School, Baradene and Glendowie College\r\n\r\nWith an asking price of $1,825,000, this is an outstanding opportunity to secure a beautifully renovated home in a sought-after St Heliers location.\r\n\r\nNothing to do but move in, relax and embrace the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated. Wonderfully private. Perfectly positioned.\r\n\r\nAll agent conjunctionals are welcome and encouraged.",
